> I don't understand what you mean.


You get a problem with a poi-bridi that ends in a sumti.

by. poi broda cy. poi brode
means that brode is attached to the cy.

by. poi broda cy. zi'e poi brode
means that broda is attached to by.

If we make sure poi-bridi end with selbri, then zi'e isn't needed.




